## PROMPT 2 — If the pipeline auto-completes (most common failure)

````
The pipeline is auto-advancing to deployed. Fix this: after the regression tests pass, the
ticket stage must become AWAITING_APPROVAL and the app must STOP. The deploy action must only
fire from the Approve button click on /approval/:changeId, and only when the rationale field
is non-empty. On app load, TKT-1001 must always be in stage RECEIVED, never CLOSED.
````

